<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post401414167547618535..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Lincoln Gambit</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>22</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8075384615934506119</id><published>2008-12-24T12:23:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-24T12:23:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I don&#39;t know if anyone else remembers this, but re...</title><content type='html'>I don&#39;t know if anyone else remembers this, but reading this article gave me a flashback to the long forgotten ABC Miniseries &quot;Amerika&quot; that aired in 1988 or 89. There is a scene in a midwestern town, the kids are playing baseball, then the national anthem begins (the Soviet national anthem) and the parade marches down the middle of main street bearing Lincoln and Lenin banners.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8075384615934506119'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8075384615934506119'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1230146580000#c8075384615934506119' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 24, 2008 at 12:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-435404274490820208</id><published>2008-12-19T11:21:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-19T11:21:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Maybe we will emulate our Roman Republic predecess...</title><content type='html'>Maybe we will emulate our Roman Republic predecessors more closely and make emperor worship mandatory.  We already have Lincoln and MLK to worship, despite being martyred by dubious interests.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/435404274490820208'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/435404274490820208'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1229710860000#c435404274490820208' title=''/><author><name>9th Company</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 19, 2008 at 11:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4068404909936320155</id><published>2008-12-13T00:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-13T00:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Nice post, Will, very nice.Appreciate  the mention...</title><content type='html'>Nice post, Will, very nice.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Appreciate  the mention of the Red Republicans. Had heard of the title previously, but now need to get it.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In line with RR and Fletcher,  literary critic Edmund Wilson said  Bismark, Lenin and Abe, &lt;BR/&gt;&quot;presided over the unifications of the three great modern powers. . . Each established a strong central government over hitherto loosely coordinated peoples. Lincoln kept the Union together by subordinating the South to the North; Bismarck imposed on the German states the cohesive hegemony of Prussia; Lenin . . .began the work of binding Russia, with its innumerable ethnic groups scattered through immense spaces, in a tight bureaucratic net (Patriotic Gore, 1962, pp.xvi.xvii).&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Glad also to see you mention the Zimbawe connection here  and  keep hammering on it in your next post.&lt;BR/&gt;As before, if the &#39;whiteliberalguilt&#39; voters (schmucks) really were looking for a 100% black, 100% African, 100% socialist, 100% experienced (at wrecking an economy) candidate,  Robert Mugabe was their man. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Further, rampant inflation preceded not only the Nazi,  but also the French and Bolshevik revolutions.  Not good precedents. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;May God keep us from repeating those dismal histories. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks again,</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4068404909936320155'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4068404909936320155'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1229154720000#c4068404909936320155' title=''/><author><name>Bob Suden</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2008 at 12:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3013831015406549701</id><published>2008-12-08T08:37:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-08T08:37:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,Your posts are consistently well researc...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Your posts are consistently well researched and written. Oh yeah, and quite bold. You realize, of course, it is a cardinal sin within America&#39;s civil religion to cast dispersions on Saint Abraham.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I thank God that He has raised up a servant in Idaho who fears and reveres HIM more than man.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Your blog has become a daily read for me. Keep up the good work, sir. It is most appreciated.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3013831015406549701'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3013831015406549701'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228750620000#c3013831015406549701' title=''/><author><name>Chip</name><uri>http://www.thideology.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 8, 2008 at 8:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2704200822329378387</id><published>2008-12-07T21:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-07T21:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This blog article, &#39;The Lincoln Gambit&#39;, is one of...</title><content type='html'>This blog article, &#39;The Lincoln Gambit&#39;, is one of Grigg&#39;s best essays. Will&#39;s always been an excellent writer and researcher, but now, he&#39;s reached the ionosphere with his skills and abilities. He&#39;s clearly improving with age. Why a paleo-libertarian magazine like The Republic hasn&#39;t picked him up as a salaried writer is beyond me.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A hat tip to Sans Authoritas, Sic Semper Tyrannis and Jerri Lynn Ward: You guys write some of the best comments. You all complement Will&#39;s comment section with your insightful observations. This blog and comment section is rated number one on my favorites section! &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And finally, I offer you all a libertarian season&#39;s greetings. Without compromising my firm belief in Y&#39;shua as the great God and Savior of the world (Titus 2:13), I wish my fellow Christian trinitarian monotheists, and the secular atheists, the Jewish monotheists, the Mormon henotheists, the Muslim monotheists and the Eastern pantheists a most splendid holiday season with your loved ones, to celebrate -or not- Christmas in the way that best suits you all. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;May we all defend each other&#39;s freedom of conscience, to believe in whatever transcendent Object or objects touches our hearts and minds without fear of violent coercion, whether that coercion emanates from private or religious institutions, mobs, individuals, or the State. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;May we all defend each other&#39;s freedom of speech. The freedom to dialogue and debate over religious/spiritual and political matters is also an integral and essential element of our inalienable human right to free speech. Let us defend these principles of liberty with every ounce of our being. &lt;BR/&gt;                 God bless, RW</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/2704200822329378387'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/2704200822329378387'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228708920000#c2704200822329378387' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 7, 2008 at 9:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6313542517017950536</id><published>2008-12-07T13:15:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-07T13:15:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent comment, Anonymous. The commerce clause ...</title><content type='html'>Excellent comment, Anonymous. The commerce clause has been used for everything from gun control to dictating business practices to regulating drugs. The Supreme Court has used an expansive Hamiltonian (or do I repeat myself?) &quot;interpretation&quot; of the commerce clause for quite some time. Will has &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/search/label/political%20idolatry%3B%20Obama%20the%20Blessed&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot; TITLE=&quot;Why Obama Will Be Worse Than Bush&quot;&gt;endorsed&lt;/A&gt; a preemptive impeachment of Obama; while we&#39;re at it, we should go ahead and lump the members of the U.S. Subpar Court in with him.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/6313542517017950536'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/6313542517017950536'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228680900000#c6313542517017950536' title=''/><author><name>Derek</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 7, 2008 at 1:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5609782823151509606</id><published>2008-12-06T18:50:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-06T18:50:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>CC Truckston, you won&#39;t regret it.          -Sans ...</title><content type='html'>CC Truckston, you won&#39;t regret it. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;         -Sans Authoritas</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5609782823151509606'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5609782823151509606'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228614600000#c5609782823151509606' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 6, 2008 at 6:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7860415640679922195</id><published>2008-12-06T13:55:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-06T13:55:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,I just read your blog for the first time...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;BR/&gt;I just read your blog for the first time, and I find it to be refreshing, well-written, informative, and Libertarian! I will follow it now. Thanks.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7860415640679922195'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7860415640679922195'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228596900000#c7860415640679922195' title=''/><author><name>C C Truckston</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04155073762735475853</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-693862812"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 6, 2008 at 1:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4653205105474648758</id><published>2008-12-05T22:37:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-05T22:37:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Yes, Lincoln forcibly destroyed the old republic a...</title><content type='html'>Yes, Lincoln forcibly destroyed the old republic and by doing so shored up the underpinnings of the northern corporatist welfare/warfare state. It wasn&#39;t until the 1887, however, that the process neared almost full bloom with passage of the Interstate Commerce Act. The larger railroads, already made fat, powerful and wealthy by feeding upon generous taxpayer provided road construction subsidies and land grants, soon desired government enforced protection from &quot;hurtful&quot; price-cutting competition - allegedly for the public good, of course. It was an insidious  dream made possible by railroad lawyers who essentially crafted the repugnant legislation. They were well aware that protecting their employers, the biggest players, from &quot;unfair&quot; competition would never be achieved in the then semi-free market system that existed prior to passage. The goal would require nothing less than brute government force carefully disguised as benevolent fairness intervention. It&#39;s all covered in Kolko&#39;s scholarly and fascinating read, &quot;Railroads and Regulation&quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4653205105474648758'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4653205105474648758'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228541820000#c4653205105474648758' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 5, 2008 at 10:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7191430392883840750</id><published>2008-12-05T10:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-05T10:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Naw, Gulliver it&#39;s not you! This web-world sharing...</title><content type='html'>Naw, Gulliver it&#39;s not you! &lt;BR/&gt;This web-world sharing makes me self-conscious sometimes too!&lt;BR/&gt;I also look forward to ongoing discussions via the comment posts and am disappointed when this doesn&#39;t happen.&lt;BR/&gt;It&#39;s the beginning of the month (as well as)the holiday season and many of we common folks are currently scrambling to meet the challenges of keeping our roofs and utilities - plus, enough food to stay conscious.&lt;BR/&gt;I always enjoy these essays and comments though! They keep my spirits up oddly enough. Lots of us read and don&#39;t write often due to time constraints.&lt;BR/&gt;Not to mention the endless list of &quot;issues&quot; (such a mild sounding word) we&#39;re all trying to get up to speed and speak up about.&lt;BR/&gt;My oh my, where DOES that time go?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7191430392883840750'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7191430392883840750'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228496820000#c7191430392883840750' title=''/><author><name>WorthNoting</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04474717140633126479</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_0AENbkNyl2s/SRc_Zy5qSfI/AAAAAAAAAAM/EJP2TtfXMvM/S220/bow_down_2u.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-179855895"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 5, 2008 at 10:07 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-790958553941383962</id><published>2008-12-05T01:01:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-05T01:01:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>**Not for publication - Obviously**Hey Will,Has no...</title><content type='html'>**Not for publication - Obviously**&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Hey Will,&lt;BR/&gt;Has nobody commented after I did, or have you just been too busy to read and upload the emails? If nobody has commented following me on this wonderfully educational essay you wrote, please go ahead and take my remarks down, and let&#39;s see if anyone else will step up and comment. It is unprecedented that you should only have 9 replies on this essay. Perhaps what I said put them off.&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks,&lt;BR/&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/790958553941383962'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/790958553941383962'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228464060000#c790958553941383962' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 5, 2008 at 1:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-332016176762111111</id><published>2008-12-04T20:33:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-04T20:33:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Stinkin&#39; Lincoln!(How&#39;s that for profound prose?)</title><content type='html'>Stinkin&#39; Lincoln!&lt;BR/&gt;(How&#39;s that for profound prose?)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/332016176762111111'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/332016176762111111'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228447980000#c332016176762111111' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 4, 2008 at 8:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7664152704095893707</id><published>2008-12-04T19:10:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-04T19:10:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>My guess is that Obama will put his hand on one of...</title><content type='html'>My guess is that Obama will put his hand on one of his own books to be sworn in. ;-)&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And thus shall all presidents after him.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7664152704095893707'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/7664152704095893707'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228443000000#c7664152704095893707' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_PpN1JG1keYU/R4LeYbKSzzI/AAAAAAAAAAM/kR7nNzAi74g/S220/aleguit1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 4, 2008 at 7:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4980030747143892895</id><published>2008-12-03T20:51:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T20:51:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Will,Bravo! Huzzah!Thank you for another very...</title><content type='html'>Dear Will,&lt;BR/&gt;Bravo! Huzzah!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thank you for another very educational essay. Yet another tour de force. On my next visit to the excessive Lincoln Monumental Temple here in my hometown of DC, I promise I shall give Our Dear Leader&#39;s exorbitant marble effigy (and imagine! - we were told they only build such ridiculous things in North Korea) a one-fingered salute on your behalf - surreptitiously beneath my clothes, of course, since we happily, (or so we are told,) live in The Land That Abe Built, and the eyes and ears of Those Who Protect Us From Ourselves (TWPUFO) are everywhere.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;One wonders: Shall we common unwashed folk ever be free of the Power Elite, or is the domination imperative just the way we humans are made - like the troops of monkeys and baboons from which we devolved? Whether you call them Moghuls, Mandarins, Nomenklatura, Congress, or just, collectively, Those Whose Shit Does Not Stink, (TWSDNS), they seem to have been everywhere and always with us (or, rather, Above Us, as they would have it,) and seem likely in the future to always be Above And Over Us.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;(Us, of course being the uppity peons who audaciously expect from life enough food to keep us from starvation, some shelter from the rain, and enough air to allow us to breathe. What a foolish tribe of ever-whining and importunate peasants we are! Crumbs falling from the Magnificent People&#39;s tables, indeed! Do we mangy curs imagine the loaves came free? Let us now all proceed to eat cake.)&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;TWSDNS, of course, is not how they see themselves. They are blithely certain they are TWAARTHU: Those Who Are Always Ready To Help Us. Always charitably and selflessly willing to help us lighten our burdensome loads.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I just paid the IRS $5,300 on October 15, and, always happy to help, they now have sent me a friendly letter offering to lighten my load by another $308 in &quot;penalties&quot; and &quot;interest.&quot; Ah! A great light has dawned upon me. The &quot;penalty&quot; is for being insufficiently grateful for their prior help to relieve my burden of excessive cash, and the &quot;interest&quot; is just to let me know they are always interested in my welfare.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Oh, but they ARE interested in our welfare! Why do you suppose Obama, Paulson, Bernanke, Bush And Company are so concerned about us these days? It is because we geese no longer lay golden eggs, we cash cows no longer give milk, and our asses will no longer yield grain in abundance to their plowing.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Once upon a time, not so long ago, suicide was a crime. To attempt to remove one&#39;s life and body from the ownership of the Power Elite would land you in jail. I believe they only discontinued the practice because some of us little worms started to realize and discuss the implications of it.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Will, Dear Heart, please keep the educational essays coming. If you ever wish to occupy yourself with other humanitarian works, you could always patrol the roads of Idaho in winter, looking for stranded motorists. Attach jumper cables to your tongue and your writing hand, and I bet one would find enough battery acid between the two to jump-start a Mack truck.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Kind regards,&lt;BR/&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4980030747143892895'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4980030747143892895'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228362660000#c4980030747143892895' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 8:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3648822619300432332</id><published>2008-12-03T19:45:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T19:45:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I nominate you for the Pulitzer prize.</title><content type='html'>I nominate you for the Pulitzer prize.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3648822619300432332'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3648822619300432332'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228358700000#c3648822619300432332' title=''/><author><name>zach</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 7:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310577396355097973</id><published>2008-12-03T17:33:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T17:33:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will:I am deeply concerned about your theological ...</title><content type='html'>Will:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I am deeply concerned about your theological slackness. Here you have published a lengthy blog wherein you have used Our President&#39;s Name numerous times, but not once have you shown him due reverence by adding the obligatory &quot;peace be upon him!&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4310577396355097973'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4310577396355097973'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228350780000#c4310577396355097973' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 5:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5455506053522148594</id><published>2008-12-03T15:48:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T15:48:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lincoln was also the first President to suspend th...</title><content type='html'>Lincoln was also the first President to suspend the writ of habeas corpus.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As for your contention that Obama came via Kenya, I don&#39;t think it is plausible. He surrendered a copy of a certificate of &quot;live birth&quot; to the media from Hawaii. I don&#39;t believe that conspiracy, as I had to solicit an apostillated copy of the same from Idaho, in order to establish residency abroad.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I have both the original birth certificate and the latest state-issued document which redacts much of the info. contained on the master copy. No it is not from Hawaii, but I can see the similarities and find this theory full of holes, just as I do Jerry Corsi.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5455506053522148594'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5455506053522148594'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228344480000#c5455506053522148594' title=''/><author><name>El Chupacabras</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 3:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5028941667143608211</id><published>2008-12-03T13:38:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T13:38:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>One of the most shocking and eye-opening articles ...</title><content type='html'>One of the most shocking and eye-opening articles of yours that I&#39;ve read in a long time.  I&#39;ve had prior knowledge when I read most of your previous articles over the past few months, but I truly had no idea about Lincoln&#39;s use of Marxists.  Thanks.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5028941667143608211'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/5028941667143608211'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228336680000#c5028941667143608211' title=''/><author><name>Alexander</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10315667849199111385</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2045902161"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 1:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8311764171119168927</id><published>2008-12-03T11:45:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T11:45:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I just heard a speech from the admirable Ray McBer...</title><content type='html'>I just heard a speech from the admirable Ray McBerry on this topic the other night at a &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://dixienet.org&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;League of the South &lt;/A&gt; meeting. He addressed Lincoln&#39;s use of foreign Marxist mercenaries in his quest for and implementation of total warfare. Our forefathers in the South had the sense and the guts to know when it was time to call off all bets. It&#39;s time to end this arranged marriage, and divorce never looked so good.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8311764171119168927'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8311764171119168927'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228329900000#c8311764171119168927' title=''/><author><name>Derek</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 11:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4909925643406183412</id><published>2008-12-03T11:10:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T11:10:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow!Will, what I have learned from your blog over ...</title><content type='html'>Wow!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Will, what I have learned from your blog over the years constitutes the equivalent of a graduate degree.  This post is particularly timely for me because just yesterday at a Republican club (I&#39;ve invaded them per Ron Paul&#39;s plan), the upcoming &quot;Lincoln Dinner&quot; was discussed.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As a Texan whose family suffered from the lingering effects and economically retarding result of Reconstruction and federal occupation, I never liked Lincoln. Now I really don&#39;t like him.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4909925643406183412'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/4909925643406183412'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228327800000#c4909925643406183412' title=''/><author><name>Jerri Lynn Ward</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 11:10 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8204807203447699513</id><published>2008-12-03T09:29:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-03T09:29:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Monsieur Sic Semper Tyrannis:You are free to take ...</title><content type='html'>Monsieur Sic Semper Tyrannis:&lt;BR/&gt;You are free to take any nom de plume that you wish, but the correct spelling of &quot;nome de plume&quot; is &quot;nom de plume&quot;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Monsieur Grigg:&lt;BR/&gt;Your article is, comme toujours, marvelously witty, bitinlgy sarcastic, and spot on.  The photo of Nobama underneath the Big Brother-like photo of Abe the Knave reminds me of the photo of Bush the Lesser, with what looked like a halo over his head, that circulated around the email-net a few years ago.  I love the way you liberally pepper your well-reasoned writings with outrageous similes and snippets from foreign languages.  My only regret is not having discovered your archived blogs until very recently.  Touché encore!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;There is at least one strong Nobama supporter who has already seen, through the sainted one&#39;s already named appointee wannabes, that Oh! Bama! is merely another lying, political weasel.  Check out Ted Rall&#39;s cartoon of disillusionment at http://news.yahoo.com/edcartoons/tedrall.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Bill Fairchild&lt;BR/&gt;Franklin, TN</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8204807203447699513'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/8204807203447699513'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228321740000#c8204807203447699513' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2008 at 9:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3918808296895765790</id><published>2008-12-02T22:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-12-02T22:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Ahhh, yes - Thomas DiLorenzo opened my eyes to &quot;Th...</title><content type='html'>Ahhh, yes - Thomas DiLorenzo opened my eyes to &quot;The Real Lincoln&quot; many years ago.  Truly amerika&#39;s first dictator.  Personally, I&#39;d like to see his effigy drug from it monumental perch in much the same way Sadam&#39;s was on all our T.V. screens.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It is also why I have the &#39;nome de plume&#39; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3918808296895765790'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/401414167547618535/comments/default/3918808296895765790'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html?showComment=1228280520000#c3918808296895765790' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/12/lincoln-gambit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-401414167547618535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/401414167547618535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 2, 2008 at 10:02 PM"/></entry></feed>